          "notes": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:1587); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as a formula shorthand for a cerium nitrate hydrate; left unmapped pending exact formula/CAS evidence. The 2026-11-08 source review resolves the former formula/CAS gap with independent primary evidence. The exact hydrate CAS is distinct from the broader MeSH family; see campaign proposal and retained historical notes.",
